gallery_gallery = BeautyStoreGallery("Our Space", "Sip, See, Savor", "Explore the ambience that turns every coffee moment into a story. From sun‑lit tables to handcrafted latte art, each image captures the heart of BrewStory Café.", "A quiet corner where the morning light meets the aroma of freshly ground beans.", ["Cozy corner with reclaimed wood tables and a barista preparing espresso","Sunset view from the patio with string lights and a latte on a wooden tray","Close‑up of latte art featuring a delicate leaf design","Shelf of artisanal coffee beans in glass jars with rustic labels","Community board displaying upcoming coffee tasting events"])
